WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.000
Long ago, computers filled whole rooms.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.500
Then they got smaller and much faster, and lots of pictures and words went online.

00:06.500 --> 00:08.500
Now Pip can learn from all of it.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
Meet some AI helpers: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and Grok.
